# PDS4 labels are archive artefacts. Their bytes are the evidence: the labels'
# own md5_checksum values are quoted in docs/stages/REAL-DATA_LRO_NAC.md, and the
# file_size identity check in src/siim/ingest/pds4.py is validated against them.
# Git's line-ending normalisation would silently rewrite CRLF/LF and break both,
# so these files are treated as binary-exact and never normalised.
*.xml -text
*.lbl -text
